# Zangineer's fixed Open Lovable: your keys.
# 1. Copy this file and name the copy .env.local (Mac: cp .env.example .env.local  ·  Windows: copy .env.example .env.local)
# 2. Paste each key right after its = sign. No spaces, no quote marks. Then SAVE the file.
# 3. Never share .env.local with anyone. These keys are like passwords.

# Firecrawl reads the website. Free plan: https://firecrawl.dev  (the key starts with fc-)
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=

# E2B builds your site in a cloud computer. Free plan: https://e2b.dev  (the key starts with e2b_)
E2B_API_KEY=

# The AI that writes the code. Free models, no card: https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys  (the key starts with sk-or-)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Remove the # at the start of a line only if you use that service.
# Google Gemini (free only for some Google accounts): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# OpenAI (paid): https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Anthropic Claude (paid): https://console.anthropic.com
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Use Vercel's sandbox instead of E2B (needs the Vercel CLI: vercel link, then vercel env pull)
# SANDBOX_PROVIDER=vercel
